              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūnitonga kūja kū lwande lwa dakama, nūkabona ko mita gūlolelile dakama, aho wajipima ī ndugu jago nī libīndo, nasho shūbiza na shipimo gītī ī sha mibita ī yīngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
