          "text": "Ī hanze ya mita gwa mu gatī, ū mu gwalugwa ya mu gatī, shalīho chumba shibīlī, shimò bbihī na mita gwa sukuma ūyo gūlolilelile dakama, ī shingī bbihī na mita gwa dakama ūyo gūlolelile sukuma. ",
